        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;peer-to-peer&lt;/b&gt;  ·  1-byte kind + JSON body  ·  UDP&#xa;0  KV — versioned set/delete, last-write-wins&#xa;1  Chat — broadcast&#xa;2·3  StateRequest / StateResponse — full KV + recent&#xa;        chat on join, merged by version&#xa;4  PeerGossip — known peers, every 10 s&#xa;5  Hello — peer learning + heartbeat (5 s)&#xa;6  Goodbye — clean leave on Ctrl+Q" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e6f2ff;strokeColor=#0000CC;" parent="1" vertex="1">
