        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes.&lt;/b&gt;  Transport is plain UDP — no acks, no auth, no anti-entropy (a dropped write is not re-sent) — a &#34;Pre-PoC&#34;.  KV convergence: each write carries a version = Lamport counter + node-address tiebreak; the newer version wins on every node, and deletes are versioned tombstones so a stale set cannot resurrect a key.  A joining node pulls one peer&#39;s snapshot and &lt;i&gt;merges&lt;/i&gt; by version (never blindly overwriting).  Each discovery node persists its KV store to a JSON file, loaded on startup before contacting bootstrap, so keys survive a restart." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f9f9f9;strokeColor=#999999;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="55" y="700" width="750" height="95" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
